config ALIF_CPU_FREQ_PSTATE
	bool "RTSS cpu_freq_pstate_set hook"
	depends on RTSS_HE || RTSS_HP
	select HAS_CPU_FREQ
	select SYSTEM_CLOCK_HW_CYCLES_PER_SEC_RUNTIME_UPDATE
	select PM_DEVICE
	help
	  Implement cpu_freq_pstate_set() for Alif RTSS. Each P-state
	  overlays aipm_run_default and is sent to the Secure Enclave.
	  Off by default until the hook is stable; enable from prj.conf.

	  The hook is not IRQ-safe (device PM, SE service). Do not set
	  CONFIG_CPU_FREQ; the governor calls cpu_freq_pstate_set() from
	  a timer ISR. The SoC file build-asserts if both are on. Drop
	  that assert when a workqueue owns the governor and any manual
	  P-states.
